# Three.js

Enhances the site — **does not replace it**.

## Allowed accents

Hero fog/particles/rain/dust/glow · character depth aids · stylized skyline peek · map accents · optional footer loop

## Rules

- Client-only; `dynamic(..., { ssr: false })` inside client modules
- Mount on in-view / Intersection Observer
- Cap DPR; pause RAF offscreen
- Dispose geo/mat/tex/renderer on unmount
- Fail soft if WebGL missing
- Never make WebGL the LCP or sole content carrier
- Do not load all textures/models up front

Shaders: document uniforms; keep sources in `/shaders` or colocated files.
